'''Neverending Footsteps''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Between Truth and Lies]]. It introduces [[Wild Doge]] to [[Uncanny Legends]] alongside a mechanic first seen in [[Archaeology 301: Planning]], in which some enemies only appear after a set number of [[Cat Units]] have been defeated.

