==Battleground==
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*10 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns after 58.67 seconds<sup>1,760f</sup>.
*7 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn once 5 Cat Units have been defeated, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns once 20 Cat Units have been defeated.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns once 35 Cat Units have been defeated.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns once 40 Cat Units have been defeated.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn once 80 Cat Units have been defeated, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns once 140 Cat Units have been defeated.

==Strategy==
The stage isn't that hard because of the Celeboodles and Sir Seals providing a constant money supply. In this stage, [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] is recommended for his ability to slow [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] to keep Relic Bun-Bun in place. If you have his True Form, he will deal more damage, as well as disabling the Curse abilities of the enemies. [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] is also a good choice to clear the path by freezing Relic Bun Bun or Lowkey and killing the peons. [[Future Cat]] or [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] are good [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic]] meatshields for the Sir Rels and Relic Bun-Bun, while [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] is universally helpful.

==Trivia==
*Neverending Footsteps' Japanese name, Hajimari e Tsuzuku Ashiato (はじまりへ続く足跡, "Footsteps Leading to the Beginning"), may refer to how the stage has the same [[Relic Bun-Bun|boss]], [[Backgrounds|background]] and enemy base as [[An Ancient Curse]], which is at the beginning of [[Uncanny Legends]]. It could also hint at [[Great Ape Luza]], who is considered the origin of humanity, or the energy said to be the origin of all things mentioned in [[Zero Luza]]'s Japanese description.

